{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t差餉物業估價署數據顯示，本港9月私人住宅售價指數連升兩個月，報320.8，按月升0.19%，按年升9.3%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n今年首9個月，樓價累計上升逾7%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n按單位面積劃分，中小型單位樓價按月升0.16%，按年升9.3%；大型單位樓價按月升0.8%，按年升9.5%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n租金指數再創新高，連升11個月，9月報212.2，按月升0.47%，按年升約6.2%。今年首9個月累計升5.8%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:09.574629+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:10:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:51.250877+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:15.590136+00:00","content_hash":"d8990d0a52954c7ccd50d5ce4659d694b16b16e445534a9db3a2a0fa0d13486b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}